Revision history for Crypt-KpqC

0.1.1  2026-11-03
    - Add KpqC as the recommended public namespace.
    - Retain Crypt::KpqC as an alternate namespace for the same API.

0.1.0  2026-11-03
    - Add synchronous Perl APIs for AIMer, HAETAE, NTRU+, and SMAUG-T.
    - Bundle the pinned native reference implementations.
    - Add API and known-answer tests for all supported parameter sets.
